TITLE Calcite kinetic dissolution at 100C, pH 5, pe 4
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 5 charge
    pe 4
    C(4) 0.0005
    Mn 0.001
    units mol/kgw

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -formula CaCO3 1.0
        -m0 1.0
        -m  1.0
        -parms 10.0 0.001
        -steps 10 in 100
        -tol 1e-12

RATES
Calcite
-start
10 ssa = PARM(1)
20 k   = PARM(2)
30 rate = ssa * k
40 if (SI("Calcite") >= 0) then rate = 0
50 moles = rate * TIME
60 SAVE moles
-end

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file calcite_kinetics.sel
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -totals C
END